# Backend

- Express is 4.x. Do not weaken `requireAuth`, `requirePasswordChanged`,
  or `requireAdmin` coverage. Keep `/api/health`, `/api/ready`, login,
  and session checks separate from authenticated routes.
- One active device session per account; keep hashed tokens, secure cookie
  attributes, and revocation after account changes.
- Enforce owner/admin checks on projects, files, assets, history, usage,
  and output. Return non-disclosing `404` where existence would leak data.
- Bind async save / run / upload / asset / mask writes to the initiating
  `tabId + projectId + documentEpoch`.
- Keep destructive multi-table operations transactional; preserve recovery
  windows and referenced-asset deletion guards.
- Never expose AI gateway keys to clients or logs. Never call paid or real
  AI providers from automated tests without explicit user authorization.
- API易 changes (providers, model IDs, prompts, retries, billing) follow
  `AGENTS.md` section 5: check offline snapshot, cite local page + SHA-256.
